  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: E Gadiaufala</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient settlement or road station attested in the Peutinger Map, but otherwise unknown and unlocateable. The map places it together with several other unlocated places on a route in modern Algeria between Gadifaula (modern Ksar Sbehi) and Vatari (which might be modern Fedj es Siouda).",
